        <small>★ default · QS QuickShip · MTO Made-to-Order · + companion (EMB, <span class="aa" aria-hidden="true">Ⓐ</span>CS sensor, T-Grid · separate line items) · CCT on J-Box dip (<a href="#controls" style="color:var(--brand-red); text-decoration:underline;">§5</a>)</small>
      </p>
    </div>

