                <span class="cfg-chip-code">LDRS8</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="cfg-field-notes" style="margin-top:6px; font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted); letter-spacing:0.04em;">All 4 sizes hold the 2-hour UL 263 + ASTM E119 rating. Companion gating: JBM EMB accessory ships for 6&Prime; + 8&Prime; only per datasheet. T-Grid Installation Kits ship in 4&Prime; + 6&Prime; only (no 3&Prime; or 8&Prime; T-grid kit).</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pack Size — 2 chips: Single Pack or 6-Pack carton.
               Per Nebula-II canonical pack pattern · contractor cartons ship 6× per box.
               Trim is locked to Flat (/F) per datasheet — no Baffle variant in this catalog. -->
